# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Rust / Tauri — artefactos de compilación y código generado
**/src-tauri/target
**/src-tauri/gen

# Environment / secrets
.env

# Claves de firma del actualizador de Tauri. La privada vive en ~/.tauri,
# FUERA del repo; estos patrones son la red por si alguien la copia aquí.
*.key
*.key.pub
.env.*
!.env.example

# Defensive: never accidentally commit untracked Markdown notes from root.
# (Tracked docs/*.md still work because they were `git add`ed explicitly.)
/*.md
!README.md

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
